[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,60,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1.5,0,1,3.8,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 10,0:02:05.07,0:02:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I used the back of my swords.Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.61,0:02:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to knock out all the shipwrights?!Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro's so strong! Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.36,0:02:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever, let's get going! Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.43,0:02:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, this way!Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.85,0:02:17.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yup.Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.57,0:02:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, this way! Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.41,0:02:22.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't even follow us when we're leading the way?!Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.19,0:02:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an absolute marvel!Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.27,0:02:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! I got out... since I'm rubber! Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.09,0:02:41.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good job! Okay!  Get me out of these things!Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.50,0:02:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.11,0:02:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bull and skull had better watch out! Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.45,0:02:59.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been undercover for five years. Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.16,0:03:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry. We took our cover jobs seriously. Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand your despair. Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.67,0:03:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, we cannot spend any more time on this matter.Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.99,0:03:19.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, We will achieve our goal by any means necessary. Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.04,0:03:23.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you plan on fighting back, don't bother. Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.79,0:03:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've heard of "Cipher Pol," right? Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.89,0:03:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CPı through CP8 are the government's top intelligence agencies, Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.78,0:03:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,stationed at eight bases around the world. Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.38,0:03:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When the government orders it, they dig up information from anywhere. Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.10,0:03:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard of them... Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.97,0:03:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but only up to CP8.Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally.Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.10,0:03:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, we are CP9, the ninth Cipher Pol, a supposedly nonexistent unit.Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.71,0:03:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since we possess certain privileges, we can't operate publicly. Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.90,0:03:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Privileges? Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.59,0:04:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.09,0:04:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While we may serve justice,Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.94,0:04:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,some citizens refuse to comply with the government.Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.43,0:04:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are licensed to execute them.Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.11,0:04:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How self-serving! Murder in the name of justice is still murder!Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.03,0:04:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Government has changed its approach.Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.41,0:04:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rather than living in fear of the weapon's restoration, Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they decided to awaken itDialogue: 10,0:04:27.69,0:04:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to use as a force of justice and end this Great Pirate Era. Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.39,0:04:37.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, And yet, you don't want to help them. Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.07,0:04:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As we speak, pirates are constantly victimizing people around the world.Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.45,0:04:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet, you say you won't help them.Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.34,0:04:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What nonsense. Restore that weapon, and the world will only fight over its power. Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.44,0:04:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There will only be more victims!Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.97,0:04:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems like you don't trust the government, Iceburg-san. Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.75,0:05:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, I just know human nature, boy. Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.61,0:05:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch your tongue.  I don't work for you anymore.Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.25,0:05:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku, check his pulse.Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.73,0:05:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.68,0:05:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san,Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.62,0:05:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to tell you the truth, we arrived at a hypothesis a while ago. Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.15,0:05:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is listen  quietly while I explain it to you.Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.31,0:05:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your pulse will tell us the truth. Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.79,0:05:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, allow me to elaborate on how we came to our hypothesis.Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.80,0:06:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, we have doubts about your ploy of passing off the fakes to us. Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.54,0:06:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guessed that the government was coming after the blueprints,Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.98,0:06:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so you leaked the location of the fakes. Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.93,0:06:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what if it had been someone with a grudge against youDialogue: 10,0:06:14.67,0:06:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who just came to kill you?Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.87,0:06:24.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real blueprints would become abandoned, no one entrusted to their care.Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.01,0:06:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not stupid enough to overlook that possibility.Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.23,0:06:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Despite knowing that,Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.69,0:06:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you made no effort to transfer the real blueprints to anyone tonight.Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.16,0:06:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means you've already entrusted them to someone.Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.13,0:06:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the very least, you don't have them with you.Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.87,0:06:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or so we think. Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest. No misbehaving.Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is still a hypothesis. Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.19,0:06:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Of course, we have no proof. Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.36,0:07:00.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our observations over the past five yearsDialogue: 10,0:07:00.85,0:07:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,also uncovered nothing in your actions.Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.78,0:07:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In addition, the person  entrusted with the blueprints Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.21,0:07:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would need to be a proficient shipwright. Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.63,0:07:17.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With that, let me conclude our hypothesis.Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.53,0:07:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is where it gets interesting.Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.91,0:07:24.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These are the fake blueprints that you passed off to us earlier. Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.97,0:07:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you look closely, the architects' signatures are on them.Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.89,0:07:33.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Tom," "Iceburg," and "Cutty Flam."Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.45,0:07:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the bottom is the company's name: "Tom's Workers." Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.60,0:07:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might've thought that you outwitted your enemy by using these fakes.Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.85,0:07:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you never even dreamed that your enemy was hiding this close.Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.34,0:07:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was your miscalculation.Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.23,0:07:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To a thief in the night who came after the blueprints,Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.15,0:07:56.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,these would probably be worthless. Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.07,0:08:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But to us, who have lived in this city for the past five years, Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.53,0:08:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,these architects' names are very interesting.Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.07,0:08:06.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san, you have a guest. Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.75,0:08:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's Workers, led by the legendary shipwright Tom,Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.40,0:08:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was a shipbuilding company shrouded in mystery. Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.42,0:08:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think it used to be on this island,Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.73,0:08:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's no list of workers nor company registry.Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.89,0:08:26.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just the fact that you were Tom's disciple was difficult to dig up.Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,According to a government report, Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.74,0:08:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom had only two apprentices. Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.23,0:08:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the government confirmed one had diedDialogue: 10,0:08:35.83,0:08:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in an accident eight years ago.Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.17,0:08:47.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you know... Tom's violent apprentice, Cutty Flam, died? Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.37,0:08:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, I remember hearing the name Cutty Flam before. Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.37,0:09:00.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san, you have a guest. He said you'd know who if I told you "Cutty Flam." Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.69,0:09:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was about four years ago, shortly after we went undercover. Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.31,0:09:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was a man who came through Galley-La Company's gate to see you.Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.45,0:09:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He used that name just once.Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.77,0:09:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I remember too. Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ditto. Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.59,0:09:21.87,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall I show him in? Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.55,0:09:24.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No, turn him away. Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words...Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.51,0:09:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's other disciple Cutty Flam is still alive... Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.51,0:09:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and lives in this town...Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.94,0:09:51.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and has changed his name to Franky! Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.79,0:09:57.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What a roundabout way of meeting. Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.55,0:10:04.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this? Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueprints for the ancient weapon?Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.21,0:10:09.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't use the name Cutty Flam ever again. Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.71,0:10:10.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.69,0:10:14.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before I'm their target. Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.57,0:10:19.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave the island with them, Franky. Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.76,0:10:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's plain as day. Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.81,0:10:27.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never would've guessed you and him go way back like that. Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.39,0:10:31.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how much we investigated Franky, Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.93,0:10:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we couldn't figure out his true identity. Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.36,0:10:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we ignored him because he was just an ill-tempered ship dismantler. Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.99,0:10:42.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Of course, involving a dead personDialogue: 10,0:10:42.81,0:10:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,perfectly exploited our blind spot, since we only relied on the records.Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.92,0:10:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Franky Family comes to the shipyard to sell lumber. Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.87,0:10:55.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you had many chances to give him the blueprints. Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, come to think of it,Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.42,0:11:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he was more like a neighbor kept at a safe distance.Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.62,0:11:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't have the blueprints with you,Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.97,0:11:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it makes sense that you held firm earlier. Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.99,0:11:13.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you entrusted them to your fellow apprentice, Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.07,0:11:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it makes sense why you wouldn't give them to any of the Galley-La foremen.Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all this speculation, everything lines up.Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.76,0:11:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furthermore...Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.55,0:11:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your racing pulse proved it to be true! Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.11,0:11:30.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.03,0:11:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this really the right way?Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.60,0:11:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk!Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They look really hurt. Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.11,0:11:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's that door over there! I'm sure of it! Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.72,0:11:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Look at all those people on the ground! Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.02,0:11:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, you go on ahead of us! Cut down the door and get in there! Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.09,0:11:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.98,0:12:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Don't order me around!Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.03,0:12:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Wrong room! It's next door! Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.27,0:12:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Is that so? Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.69,0:12:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not your fault.Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.05,0:12:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A lot has happened tonight. Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.01,0:12:26.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're only human. It's natural you couldn't hide your frustration.Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.05,0:12:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We appreciate all you've done for us. Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.43,0:12:30.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're done with you now. Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.64,0:12:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and find Franky.Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.89,0:12:35.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.11,0:12:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.07,0:12:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Robin?!Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.83,0:12:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.74,0:12:50.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy?!Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuisances... Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.21,0:13:01.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! I've finally found you! Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.11,0:13:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Where the hell have you been?!Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.55,0:13:10.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! I'm so glad to see you again! Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.06,0:13:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec... What's going on here?Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.03,0:13:19.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well...Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.41,0:13:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.09,0:13:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie...Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.43,0:13:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-Iceburg-san... Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.99,0:13:33.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-What the hell...Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.63,0:13:39.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is going on?!Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.43,0:13:49.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie... Why... didn't you run?Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.31,0:13:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's goin' on here?! Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.61,0:13:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This almost looks... like... Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.88,0:14:03.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're the crooks who've been trying to kill you! Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.25,0:14:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys! What's with those get-ups?!Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.31,0:14:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Kalifa! Blueno! Kaku! Lucci!Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.17,0:14:23.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop jerking me around, you bastards!Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.13,0:14:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're those shipwrights who were with you! Right?!Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.14,0:14:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I know that guy with the long, square nose.Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.55,0:14:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could this mean... the assassination was an inside job?!Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.57,0:14:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What do you mean?!Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.05,0:14:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie, the truth is, we're government intelligence agents. Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.11,0:14:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll forgive us if we apologize, right? Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.03,0:14:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been building ships together every day as colleagues. Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know this is sudden.Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.27,0:15:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So if I step on Iceburg's face, would you believe me? Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.29,0:15:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop messin' around! That's enough...Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.72,0:15:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, you've got the same voice as that bull-masked man from earlier! Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.72,0:15:21.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, you bastard! You can talk just fine!Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.35,0:15:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock us?!Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.73,0:15:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't, Paulie!Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.48,0:15:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pipe Hitch Knives!Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.70,0:15:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.17,0:15:50.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still haven't learned your lesson, Paulie?Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.11,0:15:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, rope guy!Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.69,0:16:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.95,0:16:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys...Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.36,0:16:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fighting back is pointless. Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.49,0:16:19.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've mastered techniques beyond the limits of human abilities.Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After years of training,Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.43,0:16:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,these techniques, the "Six Powers," turn humans into weapons themselves.Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.22,0:16:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone who has mastered them is as strong as 100 people. Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.89,0:16:37.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go overboard with the gambling.Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.14,0:16:41.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You dummy! I was lucky today. That's why I'm treating you guys!Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno! More drinks!Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.82,0:16:46.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.46,0:16:57.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa! You're dressed like that again?!Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.03,0:17:03.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Paulie. Just divert your gaze. Okay?Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.59,0:17:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you guys?Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.15,0:17:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, never mind.Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.33,0:17:22.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, my friend,Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're going to die tonight. Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.89,0:17:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, you bastard!Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.94,0:17:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you jerk!Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.15,0:17:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum... Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.63,0:17:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.37,0:17:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Gatling!Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.37,0:17:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? It did nothing!Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.83,0:18:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How annoying...Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.15,0:18:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.41,0:18:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He disappeared!Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.01,0:18:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.81,0:18:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.57,0:18:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A normal person would've died instantly with such a hole in their neck,Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,rubber man.Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.69,0:18:58.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Straw Hat?Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were going to kill him, right?! Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.87,0:19:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you guys build ships together?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.50,0:19:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until tonight, yes. But that's no longer the case.Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.23,0:19:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you guys really are traitors?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.97,0:19:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, then!Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.91,0:19:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Look, I promised him... Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.07,0:19:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that we'd beat the crap out of whoever was trying to kill Iceboss! Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.62,0:19:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you siding with Paulie?Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.71,0:19:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I've got business with you, too! Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.45,0:19:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin! Why are you with these jerks?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.65,0:19:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna leave the crew, tell us why! Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.07,0:19:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right! They said they work for the government! So why?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.85,0:19:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You people don't listen well, do you? Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.10,0:19:53.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, I told the cook and doctor I was leaving. Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.41,0:19:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Didn't they tell you? Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.11,0:20:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did! But I can't accept it either! Why, Robin?! Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.63,0:20:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To make my wish come true.Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.85,0:20:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A wish that can never come true if I stay with you!Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.81,0:20:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To achieve my goal, I'll make any sacrifice!Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.31,0:20:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, So you'd even go as far as framing your friends for murder?Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this wish of yours?!Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.30,0:20:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's none of your concern. Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.26,0:20:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That woman...! Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.71,0:20:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's insane! Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.91,0:20:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Nico Robin?! Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.26,0:20:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you're doing?! Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.21,0:20:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is none of your business either! Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut!Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.33,0:20:46.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san! Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.09,0:20:54.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone get in my way!Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.01,0:21:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.35,0:21:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! What happened to you?!Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.89,0:21:28.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you really our enemy now?!  Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.79,0:21:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm going to have to cut this short. Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.11,0:21:43.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're on the hunt for someone important, so we're in a hurry.Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.15,0:21:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We no longer have any business here.Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.54,0:21:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nor do we have business with any of you.Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.09,0:21:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa, how much time is left?Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.49,0:21:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two minutes.Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.67,0:22:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon our abruptness, but this building  will go up in flames in two minutes. Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.09,0:22:06.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.61,0:22:07.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.14,0:22:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire is an effective tool for destroying all sorts of evidence. Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.39,0:22:18.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to burn to death, you should leave immediately.Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.69,0:22:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, of course...Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.13,0:22:26.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's assuming you can. Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.05,0:22:34.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're planning on killing us.Dialogue: 10,0:22:34.51,0:22:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin also seems to be on their side. Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.43,0:22:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, do you accept Robin's reason for leaving the crew?Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.51,0:22:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.14,0:22:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be so loud. Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.33,0:22:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon, several rooms on the first floor will burst into flames.Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.20,0:23:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, the pirates are responsible.Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.49,0:23:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These things happen. Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.91,0:23:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go your merry way while pinning this on someone else...Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.81,0:23:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just bad taste!Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.82,0:23:17.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are already criminals. No harm done.Dialogue: 10,0:23:20.93,0:23:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then...Dialogue: 10,0:23:23.77,0:23:25.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead.Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.80,0:23:29.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right. You did your part. Good work. Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.30,0:23:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.40,0:23:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you leave! Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.53,0:23:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.97,0:23:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.57,0:23:42.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't...Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.23,0:23:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,let Nico Robin go.Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.23,0:23:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where're you going now?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.81,0:23:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We finally found you!Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.11,0:23:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta my way, you bastard!Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.06,0:23:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 10,0:23:59.85,0:24:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are their bodies so hard?!Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.00,0:24:06.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our bodies are well trained.Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.05,0:24:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can make them as hard as iron.Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.54,0:24:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, that's not to say defense is all we have.Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.18,0:24:17.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said outta my way!Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.93,0:24:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paper Art.Dialogue: 10,0:24:30.19,0:24:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's dodging his punches, even though he's huge! Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.83,0:24:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's fluttering like paper!Dialogue: 10,0:24:39.53,0:24:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:24:40.70,0:24:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.33,0:24:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a...!Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.25,0:24:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum... Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.52,0:24:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.27,0:24:55.05,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 10,0:24:55.36,0:24:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He disappeared too!Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.57,0:25:03.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With explosive leg power giving that illusion...Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.29,0:25:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 10,0:25:05.07,0:25:07.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk.Dialogue: 10,0:25:07.61,0:25:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...we also float as though we're running on air.Dialogue: 10,0:25:13.21,0:25:14.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's flying! What the...?Dialogue: 10,0:25:17.17,0:25:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And... Tempest Kick.Dialogue: 10,0:25:23.80,0:25:24.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A cutting attack?! Dialogue: 10,0:25:24.83,0:25:26.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two!Dialogue: 10,0:25:26.11,0:25:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duck!Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.02,0:25:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.23,0:25:44.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:25:45.07,0:25:47.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did they just cut the wall with a kick? Dialogue: 10,0:25:47.63,0:25:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It requires enough speed to generate gale force.Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.86,0:25:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We call it "Tempest Kick."Dialogue: 10,0:26:00.33,0:26:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't we rub eyeballs on your ship, Roronoa? Dialogue: 10,0:26:05.71,0:26:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you weren't a real shipwright?!Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.81,0:26:13.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So then, when you assessed our ship, was that...?Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.13,0:26:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I assessed that ship thoroughly. Dialogue: 10,0:26:18.60,0:26:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is unfortunate! Dialogue: 10,0:26:29.59,0:26:30.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:26:36.99,0:26:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.45,0:26:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not done talking!Dialogue: 10,0:26:42.28,0:26:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. We're through. You'll never see me again.Dialogue: 10,0:26:47.25,0:26:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:26:58.41,0:27:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Hurry and catch Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:27:10.65,0:27:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa, you must be pretty confident to take your eyes off me during combat.Dialogue: 10,0:27:18.82,0:27:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Zoro!Dialogue: 10,0:27:23.24,0:27:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol.Dialogue: 10,0:27:29.19,0:27:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't need bullets to puncture the human body. Dialogue: 10,0:27:38.15,0:27:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 10,0:27:39.95,0:27:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bastard! Let me go!Dialogue: 10,0:27:42.06,0:27:45.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He captured Luffy so easily!Dialogue: 10,0:27:45.65,0:27:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 10,0:27:56.35,0:27:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 10,0:28:08.33,0:28:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 10,0:28:17.21,0:28:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:28:18.54,0:28:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 10,0:28:28.18,0:28:32.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can they be so strong?!Dialogue: 10,0:28:32.57,0:28:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you people?Dialogue: 10,0:28:36.23,0:28:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We come from different worlds.Dialogue: 10,0:28:38.59,0:28:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We in CP9 have been training our entire livesDialogue: 10,0:28:42.24,0:28:45.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to overcome the limits of the human body.Dialogue: 10,0:28:45.95,0:28:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We do this that we may risk our lives to serve the government. Dialogue: 10,0:28:51.29,0:28:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a result, we've mastered the superhuman Six Powers techniques.Dialogue: 10,0:28:57.89,0:28:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By now, I'm sure you fully understandDialogue: 10,0:28:59.96,0:29:04.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that the four of us, entrusted with the World Government's vital tasks,Dialogue: 10,0:29:04.97,0:29:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are in a completely different league than you lowly pirates!Dialogue: 10,0:29:20.27,0:29:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This matter is highly classified.Dialogue: 10,0:29:23.96,0:29:28.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It does not concern the likes of you.Dialogue: 10,0:29:30.51,0:29:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci.Dialogue: 10,0:29:32.23,0:29:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The igniters are about to go off. We have to hurry, too. Dialogue: 10,0:29:35.81,0:29:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 10,0:29:37.31,0:29:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this is a rare occasion.Dialogue: 10,0:29:40.35,0:29:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you something neat before we go.Dialogue: 10,0:29:45.52,0:29:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A devil fruit!Dialogue: 10,0:29:49.02,0:29:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which one?!Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.40,0:30:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, what are you?!Dialogue: 10,0:30:03.32,0:30:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Cat-Cat Fruit:Dialogue: 10,0:30:09.13,0:30:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leopard.Dialogue: 10,0:30:13.29,0:30:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A leopard human?!Dialogue: 10,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-He's huge!Dialogue: 10,0:30:17.12,0:30:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you look like that?!Dialogue: 10,0:30:21.18,0:30:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:29.80,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Six PowersDialogue: 1,0:02:23.04,0:02:29.80,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Six PowersDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 2,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 1,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Tim